---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <h1>Danny Huynh's Portfolio Website</h1>
  <p>By Danny Huynh. Last Updated: July 13, 2026</p>
  <svg width="150" height="150" viewBox="0 0 150 150">
    <clipPath id="circleFrame">
      <circle cx="75" cy="75" r="70" />
    </clipPath>
    <image href="/images/DHSecondHeadshot.jpg" x="0" y="0" width="150" height="150" clip-path="url(#circleFrame)" />
    <circle cx="75" cy="75" r="70" fill="none" stroke="black" stroke-width="3" />
  </svg>
  <br/>
  <section>
    <h2>Welcome</h2>
    <p>
      This is the home page of my <i>portfolio / resume</i> site.
      The purpose of this site is to provide a summary of my accomplishments and projects
      that I have been working on. This site will illustrate my interest in a variety of
      fields in <em>Computer Science / Technology</em>. This site will also demonstrate my literacy
      and progression in web development.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>
      I am <strong>Danny Huynh</strong> a student enrolled in <em>University of California, San Diego</em> currently
      studying Computer Science. I have interests in technology, mainly with building computers and developing
      mini programs. My passion in development comes from the joy and satisfaction I receive whenever I
      have successfully completed a project. I am a hard worker who values passion and quality. I believe that
      projects always require dedication to complete, where passion fuels that dedication. Quality of a project
      determines its success and value.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>